&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot Academy is on a mission to be the place people go to learn how to start and grow a business. We offer a variety of educational and inspirational content — from lessons and full certification courses to live, hands-on workshops — that provides valuable business training to people all over the world. This educational content generates new customers for the business and delights our existing ones in service of achieving their business and career goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Professional HubSpot Academy Professor - Coach who is passionate about helping customers confidently use HubSpot tools through live, hands-on small group coaching sessions. This role is ideal for someone who shows growing independence and proficiency in live facilitation and content creation, effectively applying skills to enhance customer outcomes while contributing to HubSpot&#39;s educational mission at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Professional HubSpot Academy Professor - Coach at HubSpot Academy, you&#39;ll be responsible for developing and delivering live, small group coaching sessions focused on specific HubSpot tools and use cases, as well as creating supporting on-demand educational content. You&#39;ll design engaging workshop experiences and practical learning resources that solve real customer problems, drive product adoption, and support long-term usage of HubSpot products. The role requires good understanding of adult learning principles, live facilitation skills, content creation abilities, and comprehensive knowledge of HubSpot&#39;s product offerings, as well as a passion for crafting hands-on learning experiences that deliver measurable impact at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the HubSpot Academy team and reports to the Manager of HubSpot Academy Education. You&#39;ll work alongside other Academy Professors and Customer Evangelists to develop comprehensive educational strategies that align with HubSpot&#39;s business objectives and support customers at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Facilitate High-Impact Small Group Coaching Sessions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple live, interactive coaching sessions each week for groups of customers focused on specific HubSpot tools, features, or use cases (e.g., Advanced CRM, Marketing Automation, Customer Agent, Loop Marketing plays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run sessions in alignment with standardized agendas and learning objectives while adapting to the needs and questions of each cohort in real-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate growing expertise in facilitating workshops where customers work on their real HubSpot challenges and leave having configured something concrete in their portal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create supportive learning environments where customers feel comfortable asking questions, sharing use cases, and learning from peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create Supporting On-Demand Content:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop short educational videos, workbooks, and guides that complement small group coaching topics and enable customers to review key concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create practical resources that customers can reference when implementing what they learned during coaching sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design follow-up materials that reinforce session learning and support continued product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Instructional Designers and content creators to ensure cohesive learning experiences across live and on-demand formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive Product Adoption and Usage Uplift:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design sessions and supporting content so customers leave with actionable next steps and concrete configurations in their HubSpot portals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionality to understand which specific actions and sessions drive the largest usage movement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine content and facilitation approaches based on data showing what drives measurable customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track how coaching sessions contribute to customer activation, feature adoption, and ongoing product usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Academy, Product, Creative, and Marketing teams to align session topics with product launches, spotlight moments, and strategic initiatives (e.g., AI adoption, Loop Marketing, Customer Agent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to Product and leadership on what customers are saying and where they&#39;re getting stuck&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure coaching insights inform product roadmap and enablement priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in cross-functional projects to develop educational strategies aligned with business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain Operational Excellence:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate logging of sessions and attendance via Bevy and HubSpot systems, partnering with operations teams to resolve data integrity issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established workflows for customer inquiries about registration, scheduling, or follow-up questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tools like Asana, AirTable, and Google Suite to coordinate session planning, content development, and track key metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor registration and attendance patterns to optimize session timing, topics, and promotional approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuously Improve Content and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate on session content, flow, and activities based on NPS, CSAT, qualitative feedback, and performance metrics (attendance, usage impact, repeat attendance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect session feedback to continuously improve both live facilitation and supporting on-demand content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with new formats (e.g., &quot;Build With&quot; sessions, customer guest speakers, region-specific variants)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights with the broader team to enhance the small group coaching program and on-demand content library&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and Portuguese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated experience leading live trainings, workshops, or group sessions (virtual or in-person) where you taught, demoed, and troubleshooted on the fly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess exceptional facilitation and communication skills—you can read a room, simplify complex topics, and keep diverse audiences engaged and on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong product aptitude and quickly learn new features, connecting them to real-world customer use cases across Marketing, Sales, and Service workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You effectively communicate and collaborate with customers and cross-functional teams to align on coaching objectives and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re energized by scale—reaching hundreds or thousands of customers through repeatable experiences—and see group coaching as core to the future of customer education.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re customer-obsessed and empathetic, able to meet customers where they are in their journey, even when they&#39;re just beginning with advanced features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You comfortably adjust to changing priorities in a fast-evolving environment where programs, tools, and processes are being optimized, and you actively contribute to improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can craft well-structured written content for workbooks, guides, and supporting materials that enhance learning experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You independently explore and suggest innovative approaches to coaching and content creation, experimenting with new facilitation techniques and formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with HubSpot (as a user, partner, or prior HubSpotter), especially across multiple Hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating global customer audiences across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with event platforms, and/or prior experience in scaled programs or live onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating short-form video content or educational materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The cash compensation below includes base salary, on-target commission for employees in eligible roles, and annual bonus targets under HubSpot’s bonus plan for eligible roles. In addition to cash compensation, some roles are eligible to participate in HubSpot’s equity plan to receive restricted stock units (RSUs). Individual compensation packages are determined using objective, role-related criteria, which may include skills, experience, qualifications, and other job-related factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vi7Z3asrEMcTPARkWQdsA_xeayvzgw1t/view&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt; will help guide how we recommend thinking about the range you see.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Benefits are also an important piece of your total compensation package. Explore the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;benefits and perks&lt;/a&gt; HubSpot offers to help employees grow better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;At HubSpot, fair compensation practices aren’t just about checking off the box for legal compliance. It’s about living out our value of transparency with our employees, candidates, and community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Cash Compensation Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€47.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€64.800 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At HubSpot, we value both flexibility and connection. Whether you’re a Remote employee or work from the Office, we want you to start your journey here by building strong connections with your team and peers. If you are joining our Engineering team, you will be required to attend a regional HubSpot office for in-person onboarding. If you join our broader Product team, you’ll also attend other in-person events, such as your Product Group Summit and other gatherings, to continue building on those connections.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;If you require an accommodation due to travel limitations or other reasons, please inform your recruiter during the hiring process. We are committed to supporting candidates who may need alternative arrangements&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot (NYSE: HUBS) is an AI-powered customer platform with all the software, integrations, and resources customers need to connect marketing, sales, and service. HubSpot&#39;s connected platform enables businesses to grow faster by focusing on what matters most: customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HubSpot, bold is our baseline. Our employees around the globe move fast, stay customer-obsessed, and win together. Our culture is grounded in four commitments: Solve for the Customer, Be Bold, Learn Fast, Align, Adapt &amp;amp; Go!, and Deliver with HEART. These commitments shape how we work, lead, and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a company&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hybrid-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; where people can do their best work&lt;/a&gt;. We focus on brilliant work, not badge swipes. By combining clarity, ownership, and trust, we create space for big thinking and meaningful progress. And we know that when our employees grow, our customers do too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized globally for our award-winning culture by Comparably, Glassdoor, Fortune, and more, HubSpot is headquartered in Cambridge, MA, with employees and offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore more:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;HubSpot Careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeathubspot&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Life at HubSpot on Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need accommodations or assistance due to a disability, please reach out to us&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://form.asana.com/?k=Xr9-j19kRaY5T5NjIeyx4Q&amp;amp;d=8587152060687&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://form.asana.com/?k%3DXr9-j19kRaY5T5NjIeyx4Q%26d%3D8587152060687&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1699378163995000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2_XirAqwPzHwePk2ZYcL3q&quot;&gt;using this form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Germany Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt; (m/f/d) - link to HubSpot&#39;s Career Diversity&amp;nbsp;page&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/diversity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.hubspot.com/careers/diversity&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1642285588184000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xxMKJX-6TTmbnyN6vYtUx&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;India&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt; link to HubSpot India&#39;s equal opportunity policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fTZ0ht2chl1WRI7Tgrbzh9ytZUhL2jG9/view?__hstc=20629287.8bedd818fefb24c6303ec98fcf9dcfff.1724281309795.1724281309795.1724281309795.1&amp;amp;__hssc=20629287.1.1724281309796&amp;amp;__hsfp=1818362978&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HubSpot may use AI to help screen or assess candidates, but all hiring decisions are always human. More information can be found&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hiring-ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. By submitting your application, you agree that HubSpot may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organization planning, and related purposes. We may use CLEAR ID Verification during the hiring process to confirm your identity and help maintain a safe, secure, and trusted experience for all candidates. Refer to HubSpot&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://legal.hubspot.com/recruiting-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for details on data processing and your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Our Mission: Helping Millions of Organizations Grow Better&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Team Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Enterprise Sales team drives growth by connecting large organizations (500–5,000 employees) with HubSpot’s solutions. We balance transactional and complex deals, collaborating with internal teams to achieve shared goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In this role, you’ll get to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position the value of HubSpot’s software, focusing on companies primarily between 500-5000 employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and guide prospects through the buyer’s journey to help them learn how HubSpot can grow their business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a pipeline of self-sourced leads to identify, engage, and develop relationships with potential buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dissect and qualify prospects’ business goals to determine if HubSpot can be a strategic investment for their business’ growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close business with new and existing customers at or above quota level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing and technology departments to execute sales strategy as the company introduces enhancements to existing solutions and/or releases new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring your thinking, strategies, and ideas to advance our company’s values, unique culture, and vision for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We are looking for people who have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years managing full sales cycles (prospecting to close)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3 years of SaaS sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven and consistent track record as a top producer in sales roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering product demos to diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in value-based selling (e.g., Challenger Sale)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to achieving ambitious sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive outlook and hold themselves accountable to results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong growth mindset and desire for continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and adaptability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-PZ1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The cash compensation below includes base salary, on-target commission for employees in eligible roles, and annual bonus targets under HubSpot’s bonus plan for eligible roles. In addition to cash compensation, some roles are eligible to participate in HubSpot’s equity plan to receive restricted stock units (RSUs). Some roles may also be eligible for overtime pay. Individual compensation packages are tailored to your skills, experience, qualifications, and other job-related reasons.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
