&lt;h2&gt;Team Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Upmarket Strategy team designs and executes marketing campaigns that drive pipeline growth across Mid-Market and Corporate segments. Partnering closely with Sales, Product Marketing, Customer Marketing, and Revenue Operations, the team brings go-to-market strategies to life through field events, executive programs and digital experiences. Using customer insights, data, AI-enablement, and operational excellence, the team creates experiences that deepen customer relationships, influence buying decisions, and drive revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is deeply cross-functional, you will create end-to-end, multi-channel, field and integrated marketing campaigns of high-impact aligned to regional priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires balancing strategic planning with hands-on execution, using customer insights, AI, and data to turn complex initiatives into measurable business outcomes while influencing cross-functional partners. You are passionate and have an entrepreneurial mindset with a drive to test, learn, and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute integrated marketing campaigns across digital, field, executive, ABM, and sales channels that drive pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end campaign execution, including audience strategy, landing pages, invitations, nurture programs, sales enablement, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop channel strategies across paid, earned, and owned media aligned to audience, industry, competitive, and customer lifecycle priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and manage executive speakers, customer advocates, and industry experts to elevate program impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create AI-enabled campaign playbooks and identify opportunities to improve reach, experimentation, and answer-engine visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead field program execution, including venue selection, vendors, contracts, production, logistics, staffing, and onsite delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage program budgets, evaluate trade-offs, and optimize investment based on business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Product Marketing, Revenue Marketing, and Data teams to define targeting, align execution, and accelerate pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present campaign performance, risks, and recommendations to senior stakeholders and influence business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong cross-functional relationships while effectively prioritizing, challenging, and navigating competing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for Net New business (NN) and Install-Base (IB) pipeline targets and iMRR contribution from field and integrated programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading end-to-end marketing programs in a fast-paced B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success building integrated marketing programs that combine digital and field marketing to generate pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of B2B sales processes, go-to-market strategies, and SLA-driven operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data, AI, and automation to improve audience targeting, campaign performance, and marketing effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate performance data into business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing budgets, vendors, contracts, event production, and multiple concurrent initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence senior stakeholders, align cross-functional teams, and drive execution through ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to demonstrating HubSpot&#39;s HEART values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice-to-Have Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using HubSpot or working within the HubSpot ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing to Mid-Market or Corporate buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing executive speakers, customer advocates, or industry experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with answer engine optimization (AEO), content syndication, or intent-based marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable AI-powered marketing playbooks or campaign frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
