&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HubSpot, we aim to help businesses grow better every day. We strive to have a high-performing team developing sales strategies that align with our mission to empower growth through strategic partnerships with sales leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Segment Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EMEA Upmarket Sales Strategy team acts as trusted, strategic partners to the EMEA Upmarket Sales leaders, enabling them to make data-backed decisions that increase productivity and drive revenue growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Sales Strategy Analyst for EMEA Upmarket, you will be a primary driver and owner of analytics, models, and business frameworks and processes that guide &amp;amp; facilitate the EMEA Upmarket segment to run its business. You will operate with a high degree of autonomy to define the right questions, build decision-ready insights, and influence Director and VP-level decisions on strategy, capacity, and investment for one of HubSpot’s most important segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic analytics partner &lt;/strong&gt;- Diagnosing performance, defining KPIs, and translating data into clear &quot;what / so what / now what&quot; narratives for Sales Directors and VPs to support business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &lt;/strong&gt;- Building and owning core reporting assets (scorecards, pipeline dashboards, capacity views) in Looker, Hex, SQL, and Sheets - ensuring accuracy, scalability, and stakeholder self-serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processes &lt;/strong&gt;- Designing and leading core business processes. Defining inputs, building integrated views, and surfacing risk and upside in actionable form - across core areas such as forecasting, headcount, capacity, and territory planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &lt;/strong&gt;- Acting as DRI on critical cross-functional projects and coordinating across Sales Strategy, Ops, Finance &amp;amp; other stakeholders. Aligning teams around a shared view of data, problems, and priorities and being prepared to influence without authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coaching &lt;/strong&gt;- Supporting the development of other analysts, and creating reusable templates, metric definitions, and documentation that scale the function beyond individual contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 5+ years of experience in sales strategy, sales operations, business analytics, management consulting, or a related analytical role, with meaningful ownership of a segment, region, or business line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to define and solve complex business problems, from framing and hypothesis setting through analysis, recommendation, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical toolkit, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with BI and analytics tools (e.g., Looker, Hex, Tableau, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced skills in Google Sheets / Excel for analysis and modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency querying and transforming large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven AI fluency: demonstrated ability to use AI tools, such as Gemini, ChatGPT, and Claude, to analyze data and automate processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven SQL knowledge and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning core models and reporting for a business area and using them to drive decisions with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of influencing Director- and VP-level leaders using clear narratives, visuals, and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, autonomous working environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong capability to identify personal and professional growth opportunities and willingness to expand beyond baseline responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
